<title>HUNGARY: GRABOPLAST TO RAISE CAPITAL IN 1997.</title>
<headline>GRABOPLAST TO RAISE CAPITAL IN 1997.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian home improvement product maker Graboplast  plans to raise its share capital in 1997, the company's CEO said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;Graboplast plans to implement a capital increase this year,&quot; Peter Jancso, Graboplast's CEO told a news conference.</p>
<p>Graboplast chose ING Barings as advisor for the transaction, he said, adding he could not yet reveal the size of the increase.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
